      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being a glitch, completely unmoored from reality, is a terrifying place to be. When everything feels empty, the thought of taking that final step can seem like the only logical conclusion to the numbness. If you are in a situation where you feel you have no distinction left, please know that there are people who can help you find a way to feel real again. You can reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline anytime for immediate support.",
